      "widgets_values": [
        "A high-resolution architectural rendering of a vast indoor garden atrium, illuminated by natural sunlight pouring through a large glass ceiling with wooden beams. In the center of the space stands a tall, cylindrical glass structure housing a cascading waterfall, with a spiral staircase inside. Multiple balconies adorned with lush green plants and trees of various sizes rise in layers, contributing to a sense of vertical greenery. Organic walking paths wind through the landscape, with people strolling or seated in small groups near contemporary seating areas and kiosks. The design blends modern architecture with nature, including towering palm trees, small shrubs, and expansive green spaces, creating a serene and vibrant atmosphere."
